{"unit_id": "tag:020L:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本文说明概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的各种拓扑（topologies）。一些参考文献为<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>。在此之前，我们指出，位点（sites）（如《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0003>所定义）的选择有许多种，它们在底层范畴（underlying category）上给出相同的层（sheaf）概念。因此，我们的选择可能与参考文献中的略有差别，但最终得到相同的上同调群（cohomology groups）等。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "cohomology groups", "target_term": "上同调群"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本章所研究的概形。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "概形所成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "概形范畴上的不同拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "可给出相同层概念的位点。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴", "context": "位点的底层范畴。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "由不同位点得到的层概念。"}, {"source_term": "cohomology groups", "target_term": "上同调群", "context": "不同选择最终得到的上同调群。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020M:title", "translation": "一般步骤", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [], "unknown_terms": [], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020M:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节说明构造我们将使用的位点（sites）的一般步骤。假设要研究概形（schemes）上关于某个拓扑（topology）<MATH_0001>的层（sheaves）。要得到具有该拓扑（topology）的概形（schemes）的位点（site），如《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>所规定，我们还须做一些工作。具体而言，不能简单地说“考虑具有 Zariski 拓扑（topology）的所有概形（schemes）”，因为这会给出一个“大（big）”范畴（category）。本章各节将按以下步骤进行：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们定义概形（schemes）的覆盖（coverings）的一个类（class）<MATH_0002>，它满足《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0002>的公理。概形（scheme）的 Zariski 开覆盖（Zariski open covering）总是<MATH_0003>的覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 在仿射概形（affine schemes）的范畴（category）内，我们选定标准（standard）<MATH_0004>-覆盖（covering）的概念。\n<STRUCT_0005> 我们定义“绝对（absolute）”大（big）<MATH_0005>-位点（site）<MATH_0006>。这些位点（sites）由适当地选择概形（schemes）的一个集合（set）和覆盖（coverings）的一个集合（set）而得到。\n<STRUCT_0006> 对<MATH_0008>的任意对象（object）<MATH_0007>，我们定义大（big）<MATH_0009>-位点（site）<MATH_0010>，并对适当的<MATH_0011>定义小（small）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这里的大（big）和小（small）这两个词与相应范畴（categories）的大小无关。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001><MATH_0012>-位点（site）<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0007> 此外，还有位点（site）<MATH_0014>，它使用标准（standard）<MATH_0015>-覆盖（covering）这一关于仿射概形（affines）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0002>对于 ph 拓扑（topology），我们与此做法稍有不同，见定义<REF_0003>及其附近的讨论。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0002>的概念，其层（sheaves）的范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0016>上的层（sheaves）的范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n上述做法有些笨拙，因为我们最终并未为概形（scheme）的大（big）<MATH_0017>-位点（site）得到典范（canonical）的选择，甚至也未为概形（scheme）的小（small）<MATH_0018>-位点（site）得到这样的选择。如果愿意忽略集合（set）论的困难，就可以用类（classes）来工作，并得到典范（canonical）的大（big）与小（small）位点（sites）……\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski", "ph"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Zariski open covering", "target_term": "Zariski 开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "absolute", "target_term": "绝对"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "classes", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "本章使用和构造的位点。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "位点所涉及的概形。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "构造所依据的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所研究的层。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "具体构造的位点。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "大小位点及范畴的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "相关的概形和层范畴。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "构造中选取的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类", "context": "可能不是集合的覆盖类。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "承载覆盖或位点的概形。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski open covering", "target_term": "Zariski 开覆盖", "context": "所有这些拓扑都包含的开覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "拓扑规定的单个覆盖概念。"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "标准覆盖所使用的概形。"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准", "context": "所选标准覆盖的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "absolute", "target_term": "绝对", "context": "不以固定概形为基底的大位点限定词。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "大小问题中选取的集合。"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "所构造范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "小位点的限定词及脚注中的对应词。"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "脚注中讨论大小的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "标准覆盖涉及的仿射概形。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "两个层范畴的等价。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "位点选择是否具有典范性。"}, {"source_term": "classes", "target_term": "类", "context": "忽略集合论困难时使用的类。"}], "notes": []}
