{"unit_id": "tag:020O:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是开浸入（open immersion），并且<MATH_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "此定义中被覆盖的概形。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "本定义命名的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "覆盖族中态射的所属范畴。"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "组成覆盖的态射族。"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "覆盖中每个态射的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020N:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这定义了覆盖（coverings）的一个（真（proper））类（class）。接下来，我们证明这个概念满足《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>的条件。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "真"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "上述定义给出的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "真", "context": "说明覆盖类的集合论大小。"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类", "context": "全体覆盖形成的类。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020P:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>都有 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "覆盖公理所涉及的概形。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第一个覆盖公理中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "三项公理涉及的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基变换态射的所属范畴。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项公理中的态射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020P:proof", "translation": "略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [], "unknown_terms": [], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme），设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。则存在 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0004>，它是<MATH_0005>的加细（refinement），且每个<MATH_0006>都是<MATH_0007>的标准开集（standard open），见《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0001>。此外，我们可以将每个<MATH_0008>选为某个<MATH_0009>的开集（open）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "本引理中接受覆盖的概形。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "原覆盖和加细后的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细", "context": "两个覆盖之间的加细关系。"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "仿射概形上的标准开集。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "原覆盖成员中的开集。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020Q:proof", "translation": "这是因为<MATH_0001>拟紧（quasi-compact），且标准开集（standard opens）构成其拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis）。《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>也证明了这一点。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "证明使用的拟紧性。"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "组成拓扑基的标准开集。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "概形的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "此处为拓扑的基。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020N:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，我们如下定义仿射概形（affines）的相应标准（standard）覆盖（coverings）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "将要定义标准覆盖的概形。"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准", "context": "覆盖的标准性限定词。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "将要定义的覆盖。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020R:statement", "translation": "参见《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。所谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准 Zariski 覆盖（standard Zariski covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是<MATH_0002>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0003>，其中每个<MATH_0004>都诱导与<MATH_0005>的标准（standard）仿射开集（affine open）之间的同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "standard Zariski covering", "target_term": "标准 Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "定义中被覆盖的概形。"}, {"source_term": "standard Zariski covering", "target_term": "标准 Zariski 覆盖", "context": "本定义命名的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "构成标准覆盖的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准", "context": "仿射开集的标准性。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "被覆盖概形的仿射开集。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "每个成员诱导的同构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020S:statement", "translation": "<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大 Zariski 位点（big Zariski site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是按如下方式构造的任意位点（site）<MATH_0001>，见《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 任选概形（schemes）的集合（set）<MATH_0002>和这些概形（schemes）之间的 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 作为<MATH_0004>的底层范畴（underlying category），任选范畴（category）<MATH_0005>，其构造遵循《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>，以集合（set）<MATH_0006>为起点。\n<STRUCT_0004> 作为<MATH_0007>的覆盖（coverings），任选覆盖（coverings）的集合（set），如《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>，以范畴（category）<MATH_0008>、Zariski 覆盖（coverings）的类（class）和上面选定的集合（set）<MATH_0009>为起点。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "big Zariski site", "target_term": "大 Zariski 位点"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "big Zariski site", "target_term": "大 Zariski 位点", "context": "本定义命名的大 Zariski 位点。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所构造的位点。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所选取的概形。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "构造中选取的集合。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "构造中选取的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴", "context": "位点所采用的底层范畴。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "集合论构造给出的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类", "context": "用于构造覆盖集合的覆盖类。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020N:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n《位点（Sites）》引理<REF_0001>表明，选定范畴（category）<MATH_0001>之后，<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaves）的范畴（category）不依赖上面（3）中覆盖（coverings）的选择。换言之，拓扑斯（topos）<MATH_0003>仅依赖范畴（category）<MATH_0004>的选择。《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>表明，这些范畴（categories）对代数几何（algebraic geometry）的许多构造封闭（closed），例如纤维积（fibre products）和取开（open）与闭子概形（closed subschemes）。还可以说明<MATH_0005>的具体选择并没有太大影响，见<REF_0003>节。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一种办法是假设存在一个强不可达（strongly inaccessible）基数（cardinal），并把<MATH_0006>定义为由包含在一个选定宇宙（universe）中的概形（schemes）所成的范畴（category），把覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）取为同一宇宙（universe）中包含的 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n在继续引入概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>的大（big）Zariski 位点（site）之前，我们指出，大（big）Zariski 位点（site）<MATH_0008>上的拓扑（topology）在某种意义上由所有概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的 Zariski 拓扑（topology）所诱导。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "topos", "target_term": "拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "algebraic geometry", "target_term": "代数几何"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "封闭"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "strongly inaccessible", "target_term": "强不可达"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "universe", "target_term": "宇宙"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "universe", "target