{"unit_id": "tag:03WV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为定义<REF_0001>中的大（big）Zariski 位点（site）。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>的任意 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，它覆盖<MATH_0006>并属于位点（site）<MATH_0007>，且重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）（见《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0002>）于<MATH_0008>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "tautologically", "target_term": "重言地"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "大 Zariski 位点的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "覆盖所处的位点。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "任意给定的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "位点中存在的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "tautologically", "target_term": "重言地", "context": "两覆盖族之间等价关系的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "此处的覆盖族等价关系。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03WV:proof", "translation": "由每个<MATH_0001>都是开浸入（open immersion），根据《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0001>，可见每个<MATH_0002>都同构（isomorphic）于一个对象（object）<MATH_0003>，后者属于<MATH_0004>。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0006>（两个方向都在<MATH_0007>上使用恒等映射（identity map））。此外，<MATH_0008>组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，它覆盖<MATH_0010>并属于位点（site）<MATH_0011>，见《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "tautologically", "target_term": "重言地"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}, {"source_term": "combinatorially equivalent", "target_term": "组合等价"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "使成员概形属于构造范畴的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "概形与范畴对象之间的同构关系。"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "所构造范畴中的对象。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "所比较的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "tautologically", "target_term": "重言地", "context": "覆盖族等价关系的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "此处的覆盖族等价关系。"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射", "context": "两个方向所使用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "combinatorially equivalent", "target_term": "组合等价", "context": "另一种覆盖族等价关系。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "覆盖所属的位点。"}], "notes": []}
