{"unit_id": "tag:020N:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n接下来，我们核验大（big）（相应地<SPACE_0001>小（small））仿射（affine）位点（site）与大（big）（相应地<SPACE_0002>小（small））位点（site）定义同一个拓扑斯（topos）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "topos", "target_term": "拓扑斯"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "大位点的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小", "context": "相应小位点的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "仿射位点的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所比较的位点。"}, {"source_term": "topos", "target_term": "拓扑斯", "context": "两种对应位点定义的拓扑斯。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020W:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0002>为包含<MATH_0003>的大（big）Zariski 位点（site）。函子（functor）<MATH_0004>是特殊余连续（special cocontinuous）的函子（functor）。因此，它诱导拓扑斯（topoi）的一个等价（equivalence），由<MATH_0005>到<MATH_0006>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "special cocontinuous", "target_term": "特殊余连续"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "topoi", "target_term": "拓扑斯"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所比较位点所围绕的概形。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "原大位点的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "原先选取的大位点。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "产生等价的函子。"}, {"source_term": "special cocontinuous", "target_term": "特殊余连续", "context": "所引用定义规定的特殊余连续性。"}, {"source_term": "topoi", "target_term": "拓扑斯", "context": "函子所诱导等价的拓扑斯。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所诱导的拓扑斯等价。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:020W:proof", "translation": "特殊余连续（special cocontinuous）函子（functor）的概念在《位点（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中引入。因此，须核验《位点（Sites）》引理<REF_0002>的假设（1）至（5）。记包含函子（inclusion functor）为<MATH_0001>。余连续（cocontinuous）恰指任意一个<MATH_0002>的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），其中<MATH_0003>为仿射（affine）的，都可以加细（refined）为<MATH_0004>的标准（standard）Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。这就是引理<REF_0003>的内容。因此（1）成立。可见<MATH_0005>连续（continuous），原因仅在于标准（standard）Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。因此（2）成立。（3）与（4）由<MATH_0006>全忠实（fully faithful）这一事实立即得出。最后，条件（5）由每个概形（scheme）都有一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）这一事实而得。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "special cocontinuous", "target_term": "特殊余连续"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "cocontinuous", "target_term": "余连续"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "refined", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "special cocontinuous", "target_term": "特殊余连续", "context": "本证明所核验的函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "具有所述性质的函子。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "所引用的来源章节名。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子", "context": "此处记号所表示的包含函子。"}, {"source_term": "cocontinuous", "target_term": "余连续", "context": "覆盖可被加细所表征的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski 覆盖", "context": "证明中所比较的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "覆盖对象的仿射性。"}, {"source_term": "refined", "target_term": "加细", "context": "覆盖之间的加细操作。"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准", "context": "标准覆盖的限定词。"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "所给函子的连续性。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "给出第三与第四项条件的函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "具有仿射开覆盖的概形。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖所使用的开集。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "每个概形所具有的覆盖。"}], "notes": []}
